gp -q -s 4000000000 local-duality.gp < /dev/null > results/local-duality.txt
```

It verifies the $ZZ slash 2$ case as non-degeneracy of the Hilbert symbol (exhaustive Gram
matrices at $p = 2,3,5,7,11,13$), the unramified annihilation and its failure at $2$, the
Lagrangian count for $E[2]$ over $QQ_2$ including the $|2|_2^(-1)$ correction, and the largest
totally isotropic subspace of $QQ_2^times slash "sq"$.
